'''accumber'''† (a-kum′bėr), ''v. t.'' [< ME. ''acumbren'', ''acombren'', for earlier ''encumbren'', ''encombren'': see ''encumber'', and ''a''-<sup>16</sup> and ''en''-<sup>1</sup>.] To encumber; clog.
